<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Triangle Community Resources – free and low-cost help near you</title>
<meta name="description" content="Free and low-cost help in Durham, Raleigh, Chapel Hill, Carrboro and the rest of the Triangle, from mutual-aid groups, nonprofits, congregations and public agencies: food, clothing, shelter, mutual aid, tool libraries, maker spaces and more. Updated daily.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="vendor/leaflet.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="vendor/MarkerCluster.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="vendor/MarkerCluster.Default.css">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f8f7f2; --ink:#23302d; --muted:#5b6461; --line:#dfe3dc; --card:#fff;
  --accent:#3f7a72; --accent-ink:#fff; --calm:#e4eee8; --calm-ink:#24443e; --sand:#f6efe2; --green:#2f6b3a; --green-bg:#e5f0e3;
  --blue:#2b4f7a; --blue-bg:#e3ebf5; --gold-bg:#f8ecc9; --warn:#8a4b00; --warn-bg:#fdebd0;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:7.5rem}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif}
a{color:var(--blue)}
a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1rem}
header.top{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e2ede6,#e9f1ec);color:var(--calm-ink);padding:.9rem 0 .75rem}
header.top h1{margin:0;font:800 clamp(1.35rem,2.8vw,1.9rem)/1.15 Georgia,"Iowan Old Style",serif;letter-spacing:-.01em}
header.top p{margin:.3rem 0 0;color:#3d5650}
header.top .updated{font-size:.82rem;color:#5f7570;margin-top:.25rem}
.crisis{background:var(--sand);color:#4a3f30;font-size:.9rem;border-top:1px solid #e8dcc6;border-bottom:1px solid #e8dcc6}
.crisis .wrap{padding:.35rem 1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem 1.2rem}
.crisis a{color:var(--calm-ink);font-weight:700}
.controls{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:rgba(248,247,242,.97);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.controls .wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem .7rem;align-items:center;padding:.5rem 1rem}
.controls input[type=search]{flex:1 1 170px;padding:.5rem .7rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.2;border:1.5px solid #cfc6b4;border-radius:8px;background:#fff}
.controls label.tog{font-size:.9rem;display:flex;gap:.35rem;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap}
.headrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:1rem}
.dd{position:relative}
.ddbtn{padding:.5rem .7rem;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.2;border:1.5px solid #cfc6b4;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;max-width:16rem;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.ddbtn.on{border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
.ddpanel{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 4px);left:0;z-index:20;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.12);padding:.4rem;min-width:15rem;max-height:60vh;overflow:auto}
.ddpanel[hidden]{display:none}
.ddpanel label{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;padding:.3rem .45rem;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}
.ddpanel label:hover{background:var(--calm)}
.ddpanel small{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted)}
.ddfoot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:.3rem;padding:.4rem .2rem 0}
.ddfoot button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--blue);cursor:pointer;font-size:.9rem;padding:.2rem .4rem}
.needbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem .3rem;padding:.7rem 0 .1rem;align-items:center}
.needchip{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.18rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
.needchip:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
.needchip[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--calm-ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--calm-ink)}
.needchip small{color:var(--muted)}
.needchip[aria-pressed=true] small{color:#cfe0da}
.needsum{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;background:var(--calm-ink);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-size:.9rem;overflow:hidden;max-width:22rem}
.needsum[hidden]{display:none}
.needsum span{padding:.4rem .2rem .4rem .8rem;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.needsum button{background:none;border:0;color:#fff;font-size:.95rem;padding:.4rem .7rem;cursor:pointer}
.hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;margin:.45rem 0 0}
section.city{margin:2rem 0 2.5rem}
.rw{margin:.1rem 0 .35rem;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
section.city>h2{font:800 1.9rem/1.1 Georgia,"Iowan Old Style",serif;margin:0 0 1rem;padding-bottom:.35rem;border-bottom:2px solid #b9cfc7;color:var(--calm-ink)}
section.cat h3{font-size:1.05rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;margin:1.4rem 0 .6rem;color:var(--accent)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(310px,1fr));gap:.75rem}
article.r{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:.85rem .95rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem}
article.r h4{margin:0;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.3}
.rhead{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center}
img.logo{width:40px;height:40px;flex:none;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:2px}
.pop img.logo{width:32px;height:32px}
article.r h4 a{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}
article.r h4 a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem}
.b{font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;border-radius:4px;padding:.08rem .4rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.b-mutual_aid,.b-cooperative,.b-community_org{background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green)}
.b-nonprofit,.b-public{background:var(--blue-bg);color:var(--blue)}
.b-faith_based{background:#eee8f3;color:#5b3f78}
.b-cost{background:var(--gold-bg);color:#6b4e00}
.b-new{background:var(--accent);color:#fff}
button.b{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;line-height:1.35}
button.b:hover{border-color:currentColor}
button.b.on{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:1px}
.why{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);align-self:center}
.b-pride{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);text-decoration:none}
.b-pride:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
svg.pride{border-radius:2px;flex:none}
.desc{margin:0;font-size:.93rem;white-space:pre-line}
dl.facts{margin:0;font-size:.88rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:.15rem .55rem}
dl.facts dt{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
dl.facts dd{margin:0;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.warn{font-size:.8rem;background:var(--warn-bg);color:var(--warn);border-radius:4px;padding:.15rem .45rem}
.src{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:auto;padding-top:.2rem}
.src a{color:var(--muted)}
.src a.report{display:inline-block;margin-bottom:.15rem}
.src .stale{color:var(--warn);font-weight:600}
.empty{display:none;padding:2rem;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:3rem;padding:1.5rem 0 3rem;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
footer h2{font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink)}
dl.facts dd.note{color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem}
.needs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem}
.need{font-size:.78rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);background:#eef3ef;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.05rem .5rem}
.need{cursor:pointer}
.need:hover,.need.on{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--calm)}
.needhelp{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);padding:0 1rem .55rem}
.needhelp[hidden]{display:none}
.viewtoggle{display:inline-flex;flex:none;border:1.5px solid #9dbbb2;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-left:auto}
.viewtoggle button{background:transparent;border:0;padding:.5rem .8rem;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.2;cursor:pointer;color:var(--calm-ink)}
.viewtoggle button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--calm-ink);color:#fff;font-weight:600}
#mapwrap{margin:1rem 0 2rem}
#map{height:calc(100vh - 13rem);min-height:420px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}
#mapnote{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.4rem 0 0}
.leaflet-popup-content{font:14px/1.4 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;margin:.7rem .9rem}
.pop h4{margin:0;font-size:1rem}
.pop .rhead{margin-bottom:.3rem}
.pop h4 a{color:var(--ink)}
.pop .needs{margin:.2rem 0 .35rem}
.pop .need{pointer-events:none}
.pop dl.facts{font-size:.84rem}
.pop .more{display:inline-block;margin-top:.4rem;font-weight:600}
article.r.flash{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.hidden{display:none!important}
@media (max-width:700px){
  html{scroll-padding-top:1rem}
  .controls{position:static}
  .controls .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.45rem}
  .controls .wrap>*{min-width:0;width:100%}
  .controls input[type=search],#towndd,.needsum{grid-column:1/-1}
  /* three rows that scroll sideways together, instead of one very long row */
  .needbar{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-template-rows:repeat(3,auto);justify-content:start;justify-items:start;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:.4rem;scrollbar-width:thin;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .needchip{white-space:nowrap}
  .headrow{flex-direction:column}
  .viewtoggle{grid-column:1/-1;margin-left:0}
  .viewtoggle button{flex:1;white-space:nowrap}
  .ddbtn{max-width:none;width:100%;text-align:left}
  #costdd .ddpanel{left:auto;right:0}
  .needsum{max-width:none;justify-content:space-between}
  .controls label.tog{font-size:.9rem;white-space:normal;width:auto}
  #map{height:70vh}
  section.city>h2{font-size:1.6rem}
}
@media print{
  .controls,.needbar,.viewtoggle,.crisis a[href^=http]::after{display:none}
  body{background:#fff;font-size:11pt}
  header.top{background:#fff;color:#000;padding:0}
  header.top p,header.top .updated{color:#333}
  .grid{display:block}
  article.r{break-inside:avoid;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:0;padding:.4rem 0}
  section.city{break-before:page}
}
</style>
</head>
{% macro card(e) %}
        <article class="r" id="r{{ e.rid }}" data-rid="{{ e.rid }}" data-type="{{ e.org_type }}" data-cost="{{ e.cost }}"{% if e.lgbtq %} data-lgbtq="1"{% endif %}{% if e.lat is number and e.lon is number %} data-lat="{{ e.lat }}" data-lon="{{ e.lon }}"{% endif %} data-cats="{{ e.categories|join('|') }}" data-text="{{ (e.name ~ ' ' ~ e.description ~ ' ' ~ e.access ~ ' ' ~ e.hours ~ ' ' ~ e.categories|join(' ') ~ ' ' ~ e.notes ~ ' ' ~ e.address ~ ' ' ~ e.city ~ ' ' ~ e.url|domain ~ ' ' ~ org_label[e.org_type] ~ ' ' ~ cost_label[e.cost] ~ ' ' ~ e.phone ~ (' lgbtq lgbtqia+ queer trans gay lesbian affirming pride' if e.lgbtq else ''))|lower }}">
          <div class="rhead">{% if e.logo %}<img class="logo" src="{{ e.logo }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">{% endif %}<h4>{% if e.url %}<a href="{{ e.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ e.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.name }}{% endif %}</h4></div>
          {% if e.city == "Triangle-wide" %}<p class="rw">Serves the whole region</p>{% endif %}
          <div class="badges">
            {% if e.is_new %}<button type="button" class="b b-new" data-f="new" title="Show only new listings">New</button>{% endif %}
            <button type="button" class="b b-{{ e.org_type }}" data-f="type" data-v="{{ e.org_type }}" title="Show only: {{ org_label[e.org_type] }}">{{ org_label[e.org_type] }}</button>
            {% if e.cost != "unknown" %}<button type="button" class="b b-cost" data-f="cost" data-v="{{ e.cost }}" title="Show only: {{ cost_label[e.cost] }}">{{ cost_label[e.cost] }}</button>{% endif %}
            {% if e.lgbtq %}<button type="button" class="b b-pride" data-f="lgbtq" title="Show only LGBTQIA+ affirming listings"><svg class="pride" viewBox="0 0 30 20" width="22" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="0" fill="#E40303"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="3.33" fill="#FF8C00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="6.66" fill="#FFED00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="10" fill="#008026"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="13.33" fill="#004DFF"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="16.66" fill="#750787"/><polygon points="0,0 6,0 16,10 6,20 0,20" fill="#000"/><polygon points="0,0 4,0 14,10 4,20 0,20" fill="#613915"/><polygon points="0,0 2,0 12,10 2,20 0,20" fill="#5BCEFA"/><polygon points="0,0 10,10 0,20" fill="#F5A9B8"/><polygon points="0,2 8,10 0,18" fill="#FFF"/><polygon points="0,4 6,10 0,16" fill="#FFD800"/><circle cx="2" cy="10" r="1.6" fill="none" stroke="#7902AA" stroke-width=".55"/></svg> LGBTQIA+ affirming</button><a class="why" href="{{ e.lgbtq.evidence_url }}" rel="noopener" title="{{ e.lgbtq.evidence }}">why?</a>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="needs">{% for c in e.categories %}<a class="need" href="?need={{ c|urlencode }}" data-need="{{ c }}" role="button" title="{{ cat_help[c] }}"><span aria-hidden="true">{{ emoji[c] }}</span> {{ c }}</a>{% endfor %}</div>
          {% if e.description %}<p class="desc">{{ e.description|truncate(320)|linkify }}</p>{% endif %}
          <dl class="facts">
            {% if e.hours %}<dt>When</dt><dd>{{ e.hours|truncate(220)|linkify }}</dd>{% endif %}
            {% if e.address %}<dt>Where</dt><dd>{% set m = e|maps %}{% if m %}<a href="{{ m }}" rel="noopener">{{ e.address|truncate(160) }}</a>{% else %}{{ e.address|truncate(160) }}{% endif %}</dd>{% endif %}
            {% if e.phone %}<dt>Call</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ e.phone|tel }}">{{ e.phone }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
            {% if e.url %}<dt>Web</dt><dd><a href="{{ e.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ e.url|domain }}</a></dd>{% endif %}
            {% if e.access %}<dt>Access</dt><dd>{{ e.access|truncate(240)|linkify }}</dd>{% endif %}
            {% if e.notes %}<dt>Note</dt><dd class="note">{{ e.notes|truncate(260)|linkify }}</dd>{% endif %}
          </dl>
          {% if e.link_warning %}<span class="warn">Website hasn't loaded for several days; call before going.</span>{% endif %}
          <div class="src"><a class="report" href="{{ e|report }}" rel="noopener">Report a change</a><br>{{ e|sources }}</div>
        </article>
{% endmacro %}
<body>
<header class="top"><div class="wrap headrow"><div>
  <h1>Triangle Community Resources</h1>
  <p>Free and low-cost help across the Triangle, from mutual-aid groups, nonprofits, congregations and public agencies.</p>
  <div class="updated">Updated {{ meta.generated }} · {{ meta.total }} resources</div>
  </div>
</div></header>

<div class="crisis" role="note"><div class="wrap">
  <span>In crisis? Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a></span>
  <span>Find services: dial <a href="tel:211">211</a></span>
  <span>Domestic violence: <a href="tel:+18007997233">(800) 799-7233</a></span>
</div></div>

<div class="controls" id="controls" hidden><div class="wrap">
  <input type="search" id="q" placeholder="Search names, notes, addresses: e.g. showers, no ID, 27701…" aria-label="Search resources">
  <div class="dd" id="towndd">
    <button type="button" class="ddbtn" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="townpanel" data-all="All towns" data-many="towns">All towns ▾</button>
    <div class="ddpanel" id="townpanel" role="group" aria-label="Towns" hidden>
      {% for c in by_city %}<label><input type="checkbox" value="{{ c }}"> <span>{{ c }}</span> <small>{{ city_counts[c] }}</small></label>
      {% endfor %}<div class="ddfoot"><button type="button" data-clear>Clear</button><button type="button" data-done>Done</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dd" id="typedd">
    <button type="button" class="ddbtn" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="typepanel" data-all="Any type" data-many="types">Any type ▾</button>
    <div class="ddpanel" id="typepanel" role="group" aria-label="Types" hidden>
      {% for k, v in org_label.items()|sort(attribute="1") if type_counts[k] %}<label><input type="checkbox" value="{{ k }}"> <span>{{ v }}</span> <small>{{ type_counts[k] }}</small></label>
      {% endfor %}<div class="ddfoot"><button type="button" data-clear>Clear</button><button type="button" data-done>Done</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="dd" id="costdd">
    <button type="button" class="ddbtn" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="costpanel" data-all="Any cost" data-many="costs">Any cost ▾</button>
    <div class="ddpanel" id="costpanel" role="group" aria-label="Costs" hidden>
      {% for k, v in cost_label.items()|sort(attribute="1") if k != "unknown" and cost_counts[k] %}<label><input type="checkbox" value="{{ k }}"> <span>{{ v }}</span> <small>{{ cost_counts[k] }}</small></label>
      {% endfor %}<div class="ddfoot"><button type="button" data-clear>Clear</button><button type="button" data-done>Done</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <label class="tog"><input type="checkbox" id="nf"> Hide faith-based</label>
  {% if any_new %}<label class="tog"><input type="checkbox" id="nw"> New this week</label>{% endif %}
  <label class="tog"><input type="checkbox" id="lg"> <svg class="pride" viewBox="0 0 30 20" width="22" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="0" fill="#E40303"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="3.33" fill="#FF8C00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="6.66" fill="#FFED00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="10" fill="#008026"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="13.33" fill="#004DFF"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="16.66" fill="#750787"/><polygon points="0,0 6,0 16,10 6,20 0,20" fill="#000"/><polygon points="0,0 4,0 14,10 4,20 0,20" fill="#613915"/><polygon points="0,0 2,0 12,10 2,20 0,20" fill="#5BCEFA"/><polygon points="0,0 10,10 0,20" fill="#F5A9B8"/><polygon points="0,2 8,10 0,18" fill="#FFF"/><polygon points="0,4 6,10 0,16" fill="#FFD800"/><circle cx="2" cy="10" r="1.6" fill="none" stroke="#7902AA" stroke-width=".55"/></svg> LGBTQIA+ affirming</label>
  <span class="needsum" id="needsum" hidden><span id="needsumtext"></span><button type="button" id="needclear" aria-label="Clear needs">✕</button></span>
  <span class="viewtoggle" id="viewtoggle" role="group" aria-label="View" hidden><button type="button" id="vlist" aria-pressed="true">☰ List</button><button type="button" id="vmap" aria-pressed="false">🗺️ Map</button></span>
</div></div>

<main class="wrap" id="top">
  <nav class="needbar" id="needbar" aria-label="Filter by need">
    {% for c in categories_az if cat_counts[c] %}<button type="button" class="needchip" data-need="{{ c }}" aria-pressed="false" title="{{ cat_help[c] }}">{{ emoji[c] }} {{ c }} <small>{{ cat_counts[c] }}</small></button>{% endfor %}
  </nav>
  <p class="needhelp" id="needhelp" hidden></p>
  <p class="hint">Hours change, so call ahead when you can. Tap any tag to see places like it.</p>

  <div id="mapwrap" hidden>
    <div id="map" role="region" aria-label="Map of resources"></div>
    <p id="mapnote">{{ unmapped }} resources aren't on the map because they serve the whole region, keep their location confidential, or list no street address. Switch to List to see everything.</p>
  </div>
  <div id="listview">
  {% for city, cats in by_city.items() %}
  <section class="city" id="{{ city|slug }}" data-city="{{ city }}">
    <h2>{{ city }}</h2>
    {% for group, items in cats.items() if items %}
    <section class="cat">
      <div class="grid">
      {% for e in items %}
        {% if e.city == "Triangle-wide" %}<i class="rwslot" data-rid="{{ e.rid }}" hidden></i>{% else %}{{ card(e) }}{% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
  {% if region %}<section class="city" id="rwpool" data-city="Triangle-wide">
    <h2>Region-wide &amp; mobile</h2>
    <div class="grid">{% for e in region %}{{ card(e) }}{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>{% endif %}
  </div>
  <p class="empty" id="empty">Nothing matches. Try fewer words or clear the filters.</p>
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  <h2>About this page</h2>
  <p>How to use it: pick one or more needs to see places that meet any of them. Each town is listed A–Z, including services that cover the whole region. Green tags mark community-run groups. If something looks off, check the source link or use "Report a change".</p>
  <p>Rebuilt every morning. Each day it re-pulls these live sources, merges them with a researched list of mutual aid, sharing and making spaces (found by web search and re-checked monthly), and tests every website link:</p>
  <ul>
    {% for s in meta.sources %}<li>{% if s.url %}<a href="{{ s.url }}">{{ s.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ s.name }}{% endif %}: {{ s.count }} entries{% if s.stale_parts %} <em>(source unreachable today; showing the last copy we got)</em>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  <p>What's included: free or pay-what-you-can resources open to the community. Mutual aid and community-run groups are tagged green; use "Mutual aid &amp; community-run only" to see just those. Paid thrift stores, for-profit businesses and programs that require religious participation are left out.</p>
  <p>Something wrong, closed, or missing? <a href="{{ repo }}/issues/new?template=report-change.yml">Report a change</a> or <a href="{{ repo }}/issues/new?template=suggest-resource.yml">suggest a resource</a>. Reports are public on GitHub, so don't include personal details.</p>
  <p><svg class="pride" viewBox="0 0 30 20" width="22" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="0" fill="#E40303"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="3.33" fill="#FF8C00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="6.66" fill="#FFED00"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="10" fill="#008026"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="13.33" fill="#004DFF"/><rect width="30" height="3.34" y="16.66" fill="#750787"/><polygon points="0,0 6,0 16,10 6,20 0,20" fill="#000"/><polygon points="0,0 4,0 14,10 4,20 0,20" fill="#613915"/><polygon points="0,0 2,0 12,10 2,20 0,20" fill="#5BCEFA"/><polygon points="0,0 10,10 0,20" fill="#F5A9B8"/><polygon points="0,2 8,10 0,18" fill="#FFF"/><polygon points="0,4 6,10 0,16" fill="#FFD800"/><circle cx="2" cy="10" r="1.6" fill="none" stroke="#7902AA" stroke-width=".55"/></svg> <strong>LGBTQIA+ affirming</strong> appears only when we found evidence: an LGBTQ+-focused group, an explicit LGBTQ+ welcome or affirming statement, a nondiscrimination policy covering both sexual orientation and gender identity, or a listing in an affirming-congregation directory. Hover or tap the badge to see the evidence. No badge means "not confirmed", not "unwelcoming".</p>
